'''The Stranger's cave''', also called '''the Stranger's lair''',<ref name="AcolyteVG">''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> was a [[cave]] located within an [[The Stranger's island|island]] on<ref name="Teach / Corrupt" /> the [[planet]]<ref name="AcolyteVG" /> [[Bal'demnic]].<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-10-24.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-10-24}}</ref> Throughout its walls, the cave had veins of [[cortosis]] [[metal]].<ref name="Teach / Corrupt" /> During the [[High Republic Era]], it had become the makeshift home of the [[Sith]] known as "[[the Stranger]],” and [[Darth Plagueis]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|the-stranger-s-cave|The Stranger's Cave}}</ref> In [[132 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TheAcolyteDate}}</ref> the Stranger brought [[Verosha Aniseya]] to the cave, where he tended to her wounds.<ref name="Teach / Corrupt" />

